then other: work.reply

rule w7_ans_smith_thriving
when concept=work.answer job=smith business=thriving
does answer.how
priority 1
say {w7_tone=high w7_from=b} Orders till the month's end. Can't hammer fast enough. | {w7_tone=high w7_from=b} Hinges, blades, shoes. The anvil hasn't been quiet in days. | {w7_tone=high w7_from=b} Good iron and good custom. Mark the day.
then other: work.reply

rule w7_ans_baker_failing
when concept=work.answer job=baker business=failing
does answer.how
priority 1
say {w7_tone=low w7_from=b} Yesterday's loaves are today's loaves. And tomorrow's. | {w7_tone=low w7_from=b} Baked forty, sold twelve. | {w7_tone=low w7_from=b} They're buying from the other one. Cheaper, they say.
